  <main id="main-content" role="main" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1;">
    <header class="poster-header animate">
      <h1>300 Years of Sclerosponge Thermometry Shows Global Warming Has <span class="gradient-text">Exceeded 1.5 °C</span></h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Sclerosponge-derived ocean temperature records spanning three centuries reveal that anthropogenic warming has already surpassed the critical 1.5 °C Paris Agreement threshold when measured against a true pre-industrial baseline.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="poster-content">

      <section class="metrics-grid animate delay-1">
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value neutral" data-count="300" data-prefix="~" data-suffix=" yrs">~300 yrs</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Record Length<br>(back to ~1700 CE)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" data-count="0.5" data-prefix="~" data-suffix=" °C">~0.5 °C</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Hidden Pre-Industrial Warming (by 1850–1900)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" style="color: var(--negative);">>1.5 °C</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Total Warming<br>(True Pre-Industrial)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value neutral" data-count="1.2" data-prefix="~" data-suffix=" °C">~1.2 °C</div>
